        </zone>
        <zone h='59500' id='9' name='Ontario' w='97250' x='1583' y='750'>
          <layout-cache cell-count-w='16' has-max-size-h='true' maxheight='385' minheight='385' non-cell-size-w='60' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='36125' id='16' type-v2='text' w='46667' x='5833' y='61125'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Base Year (2017): </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Index starts at 100 in 2017. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Consistent Growth: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The index steadily increased every year, with no decline. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Largest Growth Period:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Largest year-over-year growth occurred between 2019 and 2020, where the index jumped from 117 to 135 (15.4% increase). </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Overall Growth</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> (2017–2024): </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The index grew from 100 to 143, representing a total increase of 43%. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Recent Trends (</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>2022–2024): </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>From 2022 to 2024, the growth slowed but remained positive, increasing from 139 to 143. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='36000' id='23' type-v2='text' w='45833' x='52750' y='61125'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Base Year (2017)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Index starts at 100 in 2017. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Fluctuations in Growth</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Index rose consistently until 2022, peaking at 139. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>However, a slight decline occurred in subsequent years, dropping to 138 in 2023 and 136 in 2024. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Largest Growth Period</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Between 2018 and 2020, the index rose from 106 to 129, a 21.7% increase over two years. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Overall Growth (2017–2024)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The index grew from </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>100 to 136</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, a total increase of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>36%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, which is smaller than Ottawa’s growth. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Recent Trends (2022–2024)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Unlike Ottawa, Toronto’s index experienced a slight decline after peaking in 2022. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ  </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
